  "x_note": "gemmini full-body rig (brain gemini, body_mode full), pose A 'waving' (blonde twin tails with red wavy ends and teal tips, two teal ribbons, teal X hair clip, blue eyes with red slit pupils, a fang, white blouse with a teal bow, black suspenders, navy pleated skirt, black tights, black loafers; right hand raised and waving). The base is the source itself (2x AnimeSharp, keyed, 832x1664); its grin is eyes/smile + mouth/smile_open_l (base_states), the neutral eyes/open + mouth/closed are an edit and the other states are edited from that neutral face. anchor = the head's vertical line (x of the eye midpoint, between the loafers) on the sole line, so a bust <-> full switch keeps the head above the same screen x; bubble_anchor = top of the head. Built by tools/rig/build_rig.py; record tools/rig/gemmini_full_records.json.",
